- **Identity/access:** Qoder public/docs surfaces reference QoDuck as a stealth/preview offering in some navigation text, but no detailed official model card/spec/benchmark page for the exact ID was accessible in this pass. Public catalogs/APIs searched (models.dev, OpenRouter, AA, HF) did not provide a verifiable listing.
- **Specs/claims:** Local metadata claims 1M/65K context, text+image in / text+code out, free preview pricing, and suspected Qwen-family lineage; all remain unverified/speculative from accessible official/public evidence.
